{"4845130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FruitSnoot: The Snake Roguelike", "steam_appid": 4845130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FruitSnoot is the roguelike where every run is a frantic hunt for fruit, upgrades, and one more chance to grow your ridiculous little tail. Slither across bright ocean islands, gobble up fruit, dodge danger, and build a growing chain of captured fruit behind you. The longer you last, the more chaotic things get: enemies crowd the island, rare finds appear, and your once-tidy little fruit trail becomes a beautiful disaster waiting to happen. <br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture, Grow, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect fruit to grow your tail and rack up points, but watch your movement carefully. A good run can turn messy fast when the island fills with enemies, hazards, and your own winding body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845130/extras/67ed68a6178b7f510ae2d6dd04f32ff8.avif?t=1788353066\" width=528 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between the chaos, pick from upgrades that change how each run plays. Improve your chances, chase rare power-ups, and build toward a stronger, stranger run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4845130/extras/b30b3fba72faaeb6d92d33191ca2a7ee.avif?t=1788353066\" width=400 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Weird Little Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as 